{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1phYmF3YSUyQyUyMFphYmF3YSUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Zabawa, Zabawa","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9qZGTgrOmigyC853ZVeEPy1KbE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/akVYvuIJO812GAIYGerLSKnOtQO.jpg","description":"Stories of three women struggling with alcohol. Dorota is a great prosecutor. Using her immunity, she tries to avoid responsibility for her offenses committed under the influence of alcohol. Her husband, a famous politician, helps her keep the problem secret and rescues her from many troubles but he slowly loses patience. A respected children surgeon Teresa has lost her family due to drinking problem, all she is left with is her job at the hospital where she is the main doctor. The situation goes out of control when the woman comes drunk to the hospital. A student, Magda, likes to party hard and because she is a good student and has a great job, no-one opposes that. At one moment, the girl loses control. A tragedy happens.\n\nReleased 4 Jan 2019 · Poland · 88 min\nStudio: Studio Filmowe Kalejdoskop, Wytwórnia Filmów Dokumentalnych i Fabularnych, Axi Immo\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","imdb_id":"tt7419468","moviedb_id":548944,"tmdbId":548944,"runtime":"88 min","cast":["Dorota Kolak","Agata Kulesza","Maria Dębska","Marcin Dorociński","Barbara Jonak","Mirosław Baka","Dorota Landowska","Przemysław Bluszcz"],"director":["Kinga Dębska"],"writer":["Kinga Dębska","Mika Dunin"],"released":"2019-01-04T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Women on the edge","country":"Poland","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kinga Dębska","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mqj61rSizkQO83Q889j1Q45jPMj.jpg"},{"name":"Dorota Kolak","character":"Teresa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vMu479AwEce9BNuLG0jMBwfbuH1.jpg"},{"name":"Agata Kulesza","character":"Dorota","ph